+- R7: `carries_identity` (lines 304-307) requires the configured name exactly and the address ignoring letter case; `scan_commit` (lines 527-532) does not scan an author or committer line that carries it, and scans every other such line.
+- R8: `scan_commit` (lines 525-555) emits `message`, `author`, `committer`, `file #<k>` for a status whose first character is `A` or `R`, and `line <path>:<n>` or `line #<k>:<n>` when `kinds_of` on that path is non-empty; `k` is the 1-based position in the name-status list; `unquote_git` (lines 336-370) turns a quoted patch path back into characters.
